# The public repository is scoped to the reviewer-facing artifacts for
# "Channels to Targets" (EIML3 @ NeurIPS 2026). Development scratch, other
# experiments, and internal working notes stay local and are not tracked.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything at the top level, then re-include the clean tree.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/paper/
!/design/
!/stimuli/
!/harness/
!/results/

# Within the tracked tree, keep build junk, internal notes, unused figures,
# and inherited clutter out.
/paper/context/
/paper/audit/
/paper/CLAUDE.md
/paper/references.bib
/paper/main.synctex.gz
/paper/main.log
/paper/figures/results_geometry_check.txt
/paper/figures/results_mass.pdf
/paper/figures/results_abs_error.pdf
/results/README.md
/results/task_1_0_checkpoint.json
/results/task_1_0_results.json
/results/task_1_0_smoke.json
/results/task_1_0_trajectory.png

# Python / OS junk
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.log
